An exploding wand with 8 charges will inflict 10D6 damage on your PC.
That's up to 60 HP.  If it doesn't kill or at least heavily wound you,
it'll also fail to perform its intended function, which might be even
more crippling if you were relying on it to get you out of a tight
spot.

